<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="color: #147bd1;">See you tonight at Flywire's Dinner!</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">We look forward to having you join us for dinner later this evening!</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><span style="color: #147bd1;"><strong>When</strong></span>:</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Monday, November 27th | 6:00 PM - 8:00 PM</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">‌</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><span style="color: #147bd1;"><strong>Where</strong></span>:</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">JOEY Burrard<br />820 Burrard St, Vancouver, BC V6Z 1X9, Canada</span><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">‌</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><br /><span style="color: #147bd1;"><strong>What</strong></span>:</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Enjoy a globally inspired menu, handcrafted cocktails and</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">networking fun with your friends from Flywire!</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><strong><span style="color: #147bd1;">Transportation</span></strong>:</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">We are offering Uber vouchers for anyone needing transportation to the restaurant. If you would like a voucher, please email <a style="color: #223341;" href="mailto:alyssa.liberman@flywire.com"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Alyssa Liberman</u></strong></span></a> with your phone number or visit us at<strong> Booth #50</strong> in the CBIE expo hall.</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="color: #223341; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><strong>See you soon!</strong></span><u></u></p> </td> 
